      <td><code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">AlmaLinux</code></td>
      <td>AlmaLinux package ecosystem; the <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">name</code> is the name of the source package. The ecosystem string might optionally have a <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">:&lt;RELEASE&gt;</code> suffix to scope the package to a particular AlmaLinux release. <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">&lt;RELEASE&gt;</code> is a numeric version.</td>
