    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">Linux</code></td>
      <td>The Linux kernel. The only supported <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">name</code> is <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">Kernel</code>.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">Mageia</code></td>
      <td>The Mageia Linux package ecosystem; the <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">name</code> is the name of the source package. The ecosystem string must have a <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">:&lt;RELEASE-NUMBER&gt;</code> suffix to scope the package to a particular Mageia release. Eg <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">Mageia:9</code>.</td>
